    <h2>1. General Provisions</h2>
    <p>
      Sidekik is a platform that motivates paragliding pilots to actively fly by providing
      challenges and competitive features for clubs and other organized flying groups. The
      platform offers a way for paragliding pilots to share their experiences and challenge each
      other through competitions.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sidekik's target group includes paragliding pilots and clubs from Austria, Germany,
      Switzerland, Italy and around the globe.
    </p>
    <p><strong>Platform Operator:</strong></p>
    <p>
