    <h2>2. Registration and Use</h2>
    <p><strong>2.1 Limited use without registration:</strong><br />
      The platform can be used to a limited extent without registration.</p>
    <p><strong>2.2 Full use after registration:</strong><br />
      Full use of the platform requires registration. Users must provide the following
      information:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Name</li>
      <li>Email address</li>
      <li>Username</li>
      <li>Country</li>
      <li>Gender (optional)</li>
      <li>Password</li>
      <li>Club (optional)</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>2.3 Confirmation of rights:</strong><br />
      By uploading GPS tracks, photos, and comments, users confirm that they own all rights to the
