      platform, including for marketing and advertising purposes. The users' copyright remains
      unaffected.</p>
    <p><strong>2.5 Account deletion:</strong><br />
      Users who upload harmful content or violate platform rules may be deleted without prior
      notice.</p>

    <h2>3. Code of Conduct</h2>
    <p><strong>3.1 Respectful behavior:</strong><br />
      All users are required to treat others respectfully. Offensive, discriminatory, or otherwise
      inappropriate content is prohibited.</p>
    <p><strong>3.2 No harmful content:</strong><br />
      It is not permitted to upload content that could cause legal, technical, or emotional
