    <p><strong>3.4 No advertising:</strong><br />
      Publishing advertisements on the platform is not permitted.</p>
    <p><strong>3.5 Photos and flights:</strong><br />
      Photos may only be shared in connection with uploaded flights. Sidekik reserves the right to
